            "review_title": "Review at Vegetarian food TuLi KuSu",
            "review_text": "Rachel\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem 💎\nJul 2023 • Couples\nWhat a beautiful little spot, tucked away down an alley. The menu may seem simple, however the food was spectacular and super cheap. Great for vegetarians, as it takes out all of the guesswork and you can enjoy anything on the menu. My partner and I shared the Pad Thai and Soft/crispy noodle stir fry, and also had some fresh juices - would 100% recommend. We will definitely be going back if we are in Saigon again!\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2023",
